{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":["第 一 章 總則"],"text":"本辦法依地質法（以下簡稱本法）第五條第二項規定訂定之。","id":"J0020054/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"eb232a634ea4f89b28a2482914d90209a8ff975420bcee258db9d37c7c4b5f07","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0020054/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":27,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":["第 二 章 地質敏感區之分類及劃定原則"],"text":"具有特殊地質景觀、地質環境或有發生地質災害之虞之地質敏感區，包括以下各類：\n一、地質遺跡地質敏感區。\n二、地下水補注地質敏感區。\n三、活動斷層地質敏感區。\n四、山崩與地滑地質敏感區。\n五、其他經中央主管機關認定之地質敏感區。","id":"J0020054/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"70a5581b2199c9f997feb302565da464a9d1df859ff7399b0b52bcee02a6ad00","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0020054/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":112,"children":[{"id":"J0020054/a:2/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":38,"end":51,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:2/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":51,"end":65,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:2/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":65,"end":78,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:2/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":78,"end":92,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:2/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":92,"end":112,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":["第 二 章 地質敏感區之分類及劃定原則"],"text":"地質遺跡指在地球演化過程中，各種地質作用之產物。\n地質遺跡分布區域具有下列情形之一，並經中央主管機關劃定者為地質遺跡地質敏感區：\n一、有特殊地質意義。\n二、有教學或科學研究價值。\n三、有觀賞價值。\n四、有獨特性或稀有性。","id":"J0020054/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"a4859a2bd559dd85ae85320a0489e073946ac9889a4b386d98cea96ba1e872af","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0020054/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":25,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:3/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":25,"end":110,"children":[{"id":"J0020054/a:3/p:2/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":65,"end":76,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:3/p:2/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":76,"end":90,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:3/p:2/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":90,"end":99,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:3/p:2/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":99,"end":110,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":["第 二 章 地質敏感區之分類及劃定原則"],"text":"地下水補注區指地表水入滲地下地層，且為區域性之地下水流源頭地區，其具有下列情形之一，並經中央主管機關劃定者為地下水補注地質敏感區：\n一、為多層地下水層之共同補注區。\n二、補注之地下水體可做為區域性供水之重要水源。","id":"J0020054/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"5cea6ef623399cec05c451f502b932433e7e80eea4e3a1279e235558914c2646","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0020054/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":106,"children":[{"id":"J0020054/a:4/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":66,"end":83,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:4/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":83,"end":106,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":["第 二 章 地質敏感區之分類及劃定原則"],"text":"活動斷層指過去十萬年內有活動證據之斷層。\n活動斷層及其兩側易受活動斷層錯動或地表破裂影響範圍，並經中央主管機關劃定者為活動斷層地質敏感區。","id":"J0020054/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"660fb6cedc0038d8771d8368b0db474249566640fa4e4e5c2d5584539d4aeaf2","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0020054/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":21,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:5/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":21,"end":69,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":["第 二 章 地質敏感區之分類及劃定原則"],"text":"曾經發生土石崩塌或有山崩或地滑發生條件之地區，及其周圍受山崩或地滑影響範圍，並經中央主管機關劃定者為山崩與地滑地質敏感區。","id":"J0020054/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"a2618192908599412f9fe8e644730ce0635c6bcd31591fcc14c7c5bd92e94164","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0020054/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":61,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":["第 三 章 地質敏感區劃定、變更、廢止及公告之行政作業"],"text":"地質敏感區之劃定、變更或廢止，應由中央主管機關研提計畫書。\n計畫書應由中央主管機關於網際網路公開展示三十日，並知會地質敏感區所在地之直轄市或縣（市）政府。\n人民或團體得於公開展示期間內，以書面載明姓名或名稱及地址，向中央主管機關提出意見及說明，作為地質敏感區審議會審查計畫書之參考。","id":"J0020054/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"918f5bbc8e0eb56a8efc78f2419b4ad80ab1d3b8db0c69a80c55d98e2f773c7d","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0020054/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":30,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:7/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":30,"end":78,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:7/p:3","kind":"paragraph","number":3,"start":78,"end":141,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":["第 三 章 地質敏感區劃定、變更、廢止及公告之行政作業"],"text":"地質敏感區劃定計畫書應載明下列事項：\n一、劃定依據及目的。\n二、範圍說明：說明涵蓋範圍之邊界，並附下列圖說：\n（一）位置圖：標示地質敏感區位置與行政區關係，其比例尺不得小於十萬分之一。\n（二）範圍圖：標示地質敏感區之邊界，其比例尺不得小於二萬五千分之一。\n三、地質環境。","id":"J0020054/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"a79cff5da16436a8a3660f2bf5d56032134be4a9a615850e1ceae93e28279b5c","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0020054/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":135,"children":[{"id":"J0020054/a:8/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":19,"end":30,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:8/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":30,"end":128,"children":[{"id":"J0020054/a:8/p:1/i:2/s:1","kind":"subitem","number":1,"start":55,"end":93,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:8/p:1/i:2/s:2","kind":"subitem","number":2,"start":93,"end":128,"children":[]}]},{"id":"J0020054/a:8/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":128,"end":135,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 9 條","path":["第 三 章 地質敏感區劃定、變更、廢止及公告之行政作業"],"text":"地質敏感區因環境改變或新證據發現，致使地質敏感區範圍改變時，應辦理該地質敏感區之變更。","id":"J0020054/a:9","anchor":"a-9","contentHash":"210999842e29d315129b47e6b4314ba1d07f4c8e02e025c3f9789db30cd0027b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0020054/a:9/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":43,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 10 條","path":["第 三 章 地質敏感區劃定、變更、廢止及公告之行政作業"],"text":"地質敏感區變更計畫書應載明下列事項：\n一、原公告日期、文號。\n二、變更原因。\n三、變更範圍說明：說明涵蓋範圍之邊界，並附下列圖說：\n（一）變更前後位置圖：標示地質敏感區變更前後位置與行政區之關係，其比例尺不得小於十萬分之一。\n（二）變更前後範圍圖：標示地質敏感區之邊界，其比例尺不得小於二萬五千分之一。\n四、地質環境。","id":"J0020054/a:10","anchor":"a-10","contentHash":"30fda576230a04c98fd3b832f8c13619f06cc13a8a251f562544ffee7daadbcb","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0020054/a:10/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":159,"children":[{"id":"J0020054/a:10/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":19,"end":31,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:10/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":31,"end":39,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:10/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":39,"end":152,"children":[{"id":"J0020054/a:10/p:1/i:3/s:1","kind":"subitem","number":1,"start":66,"end":113,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:10/p:1/i:3/s:2","kind":"subitem","number":2,"start":113,"end":152,"children":[]}]},{"id":"J0020054/a:10/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":152,"end":159,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 11 條","path":["第 三 章 地質敏感區劃定、變更、廢止及公告之行政作業"],"text":"地質敏感區因環境改變或新證據發現，致使原劃定原因消失時，應辦理該地質敏感區之廢止。","id":"J0020054/a:11","anchor":"a-11","contentHash":"4d1b8ccc341019184b25da1d2f84653e272059395b036352735d602c9b192e5c","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0020054/a:11/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":41,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 12 條","path":["第 三 章 地質敏感區劃定、變更、廢止及公告之行政作業"],"text":"地質敏感區廢止計畫書應載明下列事項：\n一、原公告日期、文號。\n二、原公告範圍：\n（一）位置圖：標示地質敏感區位置與行政區關係，其比例尺不得小於十萬分之一。\n（二）範圍圖：標示地質敏感區之邊界，其比例尺不得小於二萬五千分之一。\n三、廢止原因。","id":"J0020054/a:12","anchor":"a-12","contentHash":"391093d2a94f29e5cb79bbb6cc677a52f1b3a01449b3ef18634fe9fc059cc93e","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0020054/a:12/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":120,"children":[{"id":"J0020054/a:12/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":19,"end":31,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:12/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":31,"end":113,"children":[{"id":"J0020054/a:12/p:1/i:2/s:1","kind":"subitem","number":1,"start":40,"end":78,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:12/p:1/i:2/s:2","kind":"subitem","number":2,"start":78,"end":113,"children":[]}]},{"id":"J0020054/a:12/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":113,"end":120,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 13 條","path":["第 三 章 地質敏感區劃定、變更、廢止及公告之行政作業"],"text":"地質敏感區劃定、變更或廢止計畫書，經地質敏感區審議會審查通過後，由中央主管機關公告劃定、變更或廢止之地質敏感區。\n前項公告後，應將範圍圖說交轄管地方主管機關保管、提供閱覽及範圍查詢案件答復處理。","id":"J0020054/a:13","anchor":"a-13","contentHash":"73810b6448f8e6aea85cff60c164e64c10bf314ed53f16506d603b0125a3c5b7","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0020054/a:13/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":57,"children":[]},{"id":"J0020054/a:13/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":57,"end":97,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 14 條","path":["第 四 章 附則"],"text":"本辦法自發布日施行。","id":"J0020054/a:14","anchor":"a-14","contentHash":"47b8a3e12a88555780e2c610257366d820f6c2f5ed79aaf37d74ac3e56199b62","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"J0020054/a:14/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":10,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[],"category":"都市計畫與土地","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國一百零一年三月六日經濟部經地字第 10104600660  號令訂定\n  發布全文 16 條；並自發布日施行\n2.中華民國一百零二年十一月四日經濟部經地字第 10204605900  號令修\n  正發布全文 14 條；並自發布日施行\n3.中華民國一百零五年四月二十七日經濟部經地字第 10504601890  號令\n  修正發布第 7  條條文","id":"J0020054","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2016-04-27","name":"地質敏感區劃定變更及廢止辦法","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=J0020054","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"123fc21ddbce175dbadbb9773e9cdc9da15be7dcde932ebf0b1734f99652300e","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2016-04-27","effectiveDate":""}}